Package: softglowos-gaming
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kevin Schmidt <https://github.com/kevinschmidt777/softglowos>
Homepage: https://softglowos.com
Section: games
Priority: optional
Depends: softglowos-base, softglowos-drivers, steam-installer, steam-devices, lutris,
 gamemode, mangohud, vkbasalt, gamescope, protontricks, winetricks,
 systemd-zram-generator
Recommends: heroic
Description: Gaming setup of SoftglowOS
 Steam, Lutris and the Heroic Games Launcher with Gamemode, MangoHud,
 vkBasalt, Gamescope, Protontricks and Winetricks. Games from all three
 launchers start with OBS's Game Capture enabled and on the strong GPU of
 laptops with two. Plus the system values of the Bazzite image: zram swap
 (zstd, half the RAM, at most 16 GB), kyber/bfq I/O schedulers, a higher
 memory map limit, no split lock slowdown, BBR and higher inotify limits.
